{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026A5EQHRruUz1793616553.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西半山采文軒分行市場經理陳敏思表示，分行新近促成西半山雍景臺租賃成交，單位為1座中層F室，實用面積1,123平方呎，採3房1套間隔，向東，享部分海景，可遠眺西九龍一帶，最新以月租6.2萬元租出，折合實用呎租55.2元。</p><p> </p><p>陳敏思表示，新租客為外籍人士，心儀上址位處半山傳統豪宅地段，鄰近蘇豪區及半山自動扶手電梯，見單位間隔合適，遂決定承租。據了解，業主於1997年以1,760萬元購入單位，持貨29年，是次出租可享約4.2厘租金回報。</p><p> </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:08.523950+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T19:38:16.753674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:31.193638+00:00","content_hash":"88df0ca7b9f4e9c217bc15b819cb472536bed7f47a53007bcaf1582cc9069103","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:08.523950+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}